type: software
title: "Task Gravity — Reference Implementation"
abstract: |
  Reference implementation accompanying an unsubmitted position-paper draft,
  "Task Gravity: Policy Attractors and Cross-Task Compulsivity in
  Reinforcement Learning Agents". The offline evidence is the tabular NumPy
  sweep. The PPO table is a separate short run and is not reproduced by the
  default CI job. DOIs are not minted.

